      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm here to help you draft a statement. Here's a possible public statement:\n\n\"We are aware of a technical issue that occurred in our database overnight, which has led to initial concerns among our customers and stakeholders. Addressed promptly by our team, we want to assure everyone that, despite the incident, we have ensured the integrity and confidentiality of customer data and sensitive information. Our systems and protocols are designed to protect against such incidents, and we are committed to transparency and swift action to resolve the matter.\"\n\nPlease feel free to adjust it according to your needs.",
