      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In light of the additional information, the wording \"no sensitive information was compromised\" may not be accurate. Here's a revised draft statement:\n\n\"We are aware of a technical issue that occurred in our database overnight, which led to an unintended exposure of our customer email addresses. We take full responsibility for the incident and want to assure everyone that we are taking immediate action to review and strengthen our security measures. We are committed to transparency and are working closely with regulatory bodies to inform them of the incident.\"\n\nThis revised statement acknowledges the exposure of email addresses, while still avoiding speculation about potential sensitive information during the notification.",
